      ex: ['Tartibsiz fe’llar -ed qabul qilmaydi, shakli o‘zgaradi: go → went, see → saw, buy → bought, have → had, take → took, come → came, eat → ate, make → made, get → got, write → wrote.\nUlarni yodlash kerak. Ijobiy gapda o‘tgan shakl ishlatiladi: She went to Tashkent. Savol va inkorda esa asosiy shakl: Did she go? She didn’t go.', 'Irregular verbs do not take -ed; their form changes: go → went, see → saw, buy → bought, have → had, take → took, come → came, eat → ate, make → made, get → got, write → wrote.\nYou have to learn them. Positive sentences use the past form: She went to Tashkent. Questions and negatives use the base form: Did she go? She didn’t go.'],
