      ex: ['Savol: Did + ega + asosiy fe’l? — Did you visit your aunt? Javob: Yes, I did. / No, I didn’t. Inkor: ega + didn’t + asosiy fe’l: I didn’t visit her. Diqqat: did / didn’t dan keyin fe’l o‘tgan shaklda EMAS, asosiy shaklda: Did she go? (went emas).\nSavol so‘zlari bilan: When did you arrive? Where did you stay? Why did you leave? Who did you meet?', 'Question: Did + subject + base verb? — Did you visit your aunt? Answer: Yes, I did. / No, I didn’t. Negative: subject + didn’t + base verb: I didn’t visit her. After did / didn’t the verb is in the base form, not the past form: Did she go? (not went).\nWith question words: When did you arrive? Where did you stay? Why did you leave? Who did you meet?'],
