      dlg: ['Tom: Where did you go on holiday? Anna: We went to Turkey. Tom: Did you like it? Anna: Yes, we did, but we didn’t swim because the water was cold. Tom: When did you come back? Anna: Last Sunday.', 'Why didn’t they swim?', 'The water was cold', 'They were tired', 'It rained', 'She says “because the water was cold”.'],
