      ex: ['Hikoyada voqealar tartibini bog‘lovchi so‘zlar bildiradi: first (avval), next / then (keyin), after that (shundan keyin), suddenly (to‘satdan), while (… paytida), because (chunki), finally (nihoyat).\n“While” davomli voqeani bildiradi: While I was walking, it started to rain. Hikoya odatda Past Simple da yoziladi va oxirida xulosa bo‘ladi: In the end, we were happy.', 'Sequence words order the events of a story: first, next / then, after that, suddenly, while, because, finally.\n“While” shows a longer action: While I was walking, it started to rain. Stories are usually told in the Past Simple and end with a result: In the end, we were happy.'],
      eg: [['First we bought tickets.', 'Avval biz chipta sotib oldik.'], ['Suddenly it started to rain.', 'To‘satdan yomg‘ir yog‘a boshladi.'], ['I was late because the bus broke down.', 'Men kechikdim, chunki avtobus buzildi.'], ['Finally we arrived home.', 'Nihoyat uyga yetib keldik.']],
