      dlg: ['Anna: Tell me about your trip. Ali: First we took a train to Samarkand. Then we visited the Registan. Suddenly it started to rain, so we ran into a café. Anna: What did you do there? Ali: We drank tea and finally the sun came out.', 'What happened suddenly?', 'It started to rain', 'The train stopped', 'They lost a bag', 'He says “Suddenly it started to rain”.'],
