      dlg: ['Agent: Good morning. Passport, please. Anna: Here you are. Agent: Do you have any luggage to check in? Anna: Yes, one suitcase. Agent: Window or aisle? Anna: Window, please. Agent: Here is your boarding pass. Boarding starts at ten at gate six.', 'Where does boarding start?', 'At gate six', 'At gate ten', 'At security', 'The agent says “gate six”.'],
